IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `P5-section-5`
IMPORT `P5-art-47-48-annex-v`

-- Tests of Articles 47 and 48 and Annex V (layer 1). Expected values are hand-written from the text, never from the code.
-- Dates: Chapter III Section 5 applies from 2 August 2026 (Art 113 second paragraph, keel fork F-113-groups, assumed): 1 August 2026 is before, 2 August 2026 is the day, 1 September 2027 is after.
-- The Omnibus changed none of these provisions, so there is one text: no version dispatcher and no as-enacted function. Art 111(2): an AI system placed on 3 December 2027 is not saved; one placed on
-- 1 January 2027 and not significantly changed is saved on 2 December 2030 (NOTHING), and covered if it was significantly changed.

`Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`

§ `Article 47(1): drawing up, keeping and submitting the declaration`

-- args of every function in this file: date asked, route, date placed, significantly changed, then the facts named in the comment
-- Draw up. Before the group applies: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must draw up an EU declaration of conformity for the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- On the day.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must draw up an EU declaration of conformity for the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must draw up an EU declaration of conformity for the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Saved by Art 111(2): placed before the date of application of Chapter III and not significantly changed.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must draw up an EU declaration of conformity for the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Covered once significantly changed.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must draw up an EU declaration of conformity for the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- form: written and machine readable, physical, electronically signed
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the declaration is in a form the paragraph names` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Written and machine readable.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the declaration is in a form the paragraph names` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Physical.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the declaration is in a form the paragraph names` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Electronically signed.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the declaration is in a form the paragraph names` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- None of the three forms: the list is not closed with 'only' (fork F-47-1-form).
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the declaration is in a form the paragraph names` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the declaration is in a form the paragraph names` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the declaration is in a form the paragraph names` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- keep: no further fact. The ten years are computed from the two dates the function takes, the date asked and the placement date (fork F-47-1-period): the last day is the day before the tenth anniversary of the placement date.
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was `#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 EQUALS NOTHING`; the caller no longer counts whole years: the ten years are computed from the date asked and the placement date (fork F-47-1-period); the case is given by the dates that make the same period, the answer is unchanged
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was `#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE`; the caller no longer counts whole years: the ten years are computed from the date asked and the placement date (fork F-47-1-period); the case is given by the dates that make the same period, the answer is unchanged
-- Asked before the placement date (3 December 2027): inside the period, as before: the function has never tested the lower end.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was `#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 10 EQUALS JUST TRUE`; the caller no longer counts whole years: the ten years are computed from the date asked and the placement date (fork F-47-1-period); the case is given by the dates that make the same period, the answer is unchanged
-- Placed on 3 December 2027, asked on 2 December 2037: the last day of the period, the day before the tenth anniversary ('for 10 years after').
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2037) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was `#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 11 EQUALS JUST FALSE`; the caller no longer counts whole years: the ten years are computed from the date asked and the placement date (fork F-47-1-period); the case is given by the dates that make the same period, the answer is unchanged
-- Eleven years after: outside the period (rule (a) of 2026-11-05).
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 3 12 2038) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was `#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 9 EQUALS JUST TRUE`; the caller no longer counts whole years: the ten years are computed from the date asked and the placement date (fork F-47-1-period); the case is given by the dates that make the same period, the answer is unchanged
-- Nine years after.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 3 12 2036) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was `#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 EQUALS NOTHING`; the caller no longer counts whole years: the ten years are computed from the date asked and the placement date (fork F-47-1-period); the case is given by the dates that make the same period, the answer is unchanged
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was `#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE`; the caller no longer counts whole years: the ten years are computed from the date asked and the placement date (fork F-47-1-period); the case is given by the dates that make the same period, the answer is unchanged
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The tenth anniversary itself is a day too many (the end-day reading of fork F-47-1-period).
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 3 12 2037) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Placed on 1 January 2028, asked on 1 October 2038: ten years and nine months after. A whole-years count says 10 and passes it; the dates do not (fork F-47-1-period).
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 10 2038) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Placed on 1 January 2028: the last day is 31 December 2037.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 31 12 2037) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The tenth anniversary, 1 January 2038.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 1 2038) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Placed on 29 February 2028: the tenth anniversary falls in a common year and is taken as 1 March 2038, so 28 February 2038 is the last day.
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 28 2 2038) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 29 2 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 47(1) the provider must keep the declaration at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 3 2038) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 29 2 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
